## 4. Engineering Evaluation Metrics

| Metric | Target Technical Objective | Evaluation Criteria |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Matching Accuracy** | Zero-fault processing of complex blood configurations. | Accuracy of compatibility matches and resource allocations. |
| **Response Speed** | Minimal latency between request generation and node discovery. | Speed of identifying available nearby resources. |
| **Location Efficiency** | Optimal travel radius reduction for fast delivery. | Effectiveness of nearby resource identification. |
| **Request Prioritization** | Deterministic sorting of life-threatening events. | Quality and logic of emergency prioritization. |
| **Communication Effectiveness** | Low-latency message delivery and high reply conversion. | Reliability and delivery rate of notifications and responses. |
| **Request Traceability** | Immutable auditing of every state change across the pipeline. | Ability to track the complete emergency request lifecycle. |
